enzyme from <italic>Chlamydomonas reinhardtii</italic></article-title><source>FEBS Journal</source><year>2008</year><volume>275</volume><fpage>1248</fpage><lpage>1259</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18266760</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gardebien</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Thangudu</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Gontero</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Offmann</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Construction of a 3D model of CP12, a protein linker</article-title><source>Journal of Molecular Graphics and Modelling</source><year>2006</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>186</fpage><lpage>195</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16427344</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Geigenberger</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Response of plant metabolism to too little oxygen</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Plant Biology</source><year>2003</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>247</fpage><lpage>256</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12753974</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Graciet</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Gans</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Wedel</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Lebreton</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Camadro</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gontero</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The small protein CP12: a protein linker for supramolecular complex assembly</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>2003</year><volume>42</vol